      ...close([['I can talk about illnesses and injuries.', 'I have a fever. I scraped my knee.'], ['I can say what helps me heal.', 'Medicine, rest and ointment help me heal.'], ['I can use «when» and «after» in one sentence.', 'When you are sick, you have an illness.']], { img: G('bruise'), q: 'Is it an illness or an injury?', ko: '병일까요, 다친 걸까요? (다음 시간)' }),
