      ...close([['I can tell an illness from an injury.', 'The flu is an illness. A sprain is an injury.'], ['I can name causes and symptoms.', 'Headaches can be caused by stress.'], ['I can say how to treat it.', 'When I have the flu, I drink lots of water.']], { img: G('cassie-ski'), q: 'What happened to Cassie on the ski slope?', ko: '스키장에서 캐시에게 무슨 일이? (다음 시간)' }),
